6:11":"vous fait (pas) de mal ?","21:67:1":"« Pouah","21:67:2":"à vous","21:67:3":"et à ce que","21:67:4":"vous adorez","21:67:5":"d’","21:67:6":"en-dehors","21:67:7":"(d’)Allâh !","21:67:8":"Donc est-ce que ne pas","21:67:9":"vous raisonnerez ? »","21:68:1":"Ils ont dit :","21:68:2":"« Brûlez-le","21:68:3":"et aidez contre l’ennemi","21:68:4":"vos dieux","21:68:5":"si","21:68:6":"vous êtes","21:68:7":"des gens qui font ! »","21:69:1":"Nous avons dit :","21:69:2":"« Ô feu !","21:69:3":"Sois","21:69:4":"froid","21:69:5":"et de la paix","21:69:6":"pour","21:69:7":"Abraham ! »","21:70:1":"Et ils ont voulu (faire)","21:70:2":"contre lui","21:70:3":"un complot,","21:70:4":"Nous avons donc fait (d’)eux","21:70:5":"les plus grands perdants.","21:71:1":"Et Nous l’avons sauvé","21:71:2":"et (avons sauvé) Lot","21:71:3":"vers","21:71:4":"la terre","21:71:5":"(sur) qui","21:71:6":"Nous avons placé de la bénédiction","21:71:7":"sur elle","21:71:8":"pour toutes les générations de chaque créature.","21:72:1":"Et Nous avons offert","21:72:2":"à lui","21:72:3":"Isaac","21:72:4":"et Jacob","21:72:5":"(en tant que) supplément volontaire.","21:72:6":"Et (de) tous","21:72:7":"Nous avons fait","21:72:8":"des vertueux.","21:73:1":"Et Nous avons fait (d’)eux","21:73:2":"des modèles suivis","21:73:3":"(qui) guidaient","21:73:4":"par Notre ordre","21:73:5":"et avons révélé","21:73:6":"à eux","21:73:7":"(l’)action","21:73:8":"(des) bonnes choses","21:73:9":"et (l’)accomplissement","21:73:10":"(de) la prière","21:73:11":"et (le) fait de donner","21:73:12":"le don charitable","21:73:13":"et ils étaient","21:73:14":"à nous","21:73:15":"des adorateurs.","21:74:1":"Et Lot,","21:74:2":"Nous lui avons donné","21:74:3":"de la sagesse","21:74:4":"et du savoir","21:74:5":"et l’avons sauvé","21:74:6":"du","21:74:7":"[le] village","21:74:8":"qui","21:74:9":"faisait","21:74:10":"faisait","21:74:11":"le mauvais.","21:74:12":"Certes, ils","21:74:13":"étaient","21:74:14":"des gens","21:74:15":"(de) mal,","2