:"violents","21:81:4":"(dans l’état où) il soufflaient","21:81:5":"par son ordre","21:81:6":"vers","21:81:7":"le territoire","21:81:8":"(sur) qui","21:81:9":"Nous avons placé de la bénédiction","21:81:10":"sur lui.","21:81:11":"Et Nous étions","21:81:12":"de chaque","21:81:13":"chose","21:81:14":"savants.","21:82:1":"Et (Nous avons rendus soumis) parmi","21:82:2":"les diables","21:82:3":"ceux qui","21:82:4":"plongeaient","21:82:5":"pour lui","21:82:6":"et faisaient","21:82:7":"du travail","21:82:8":"en-dehors","21:82:9":"(de) cela.","21:82:10":"Et Nous étions","21:82:11":"contre eux","21:82:12":"des gardiens.","21:83:1":"Et Job,","21:83:2":"quand","21:83:3":"il a appelé","21:83:4":"son Maître","21:83:5":"que : « Certes, moi","21:83:6":"m’a touché","21:83:7":"le dommage","21:83:8":"et Tu (es)","21:83:9":"(Le) Plus Miséricordieux","21:83:10":"(des) miséricordieux ! »","21:84:1":"Nous avons donc répondu","21:84:2":"à lui","21:84:3":"et avons enlevé","21:84:4":"ce qui","21:84:5":"(était) avec lui","21:84:6":"de","21:84:7":"dommage.","21:84:8":"Et Nous lui avons donné","21:84:9":"sa famille","21:84:10":"et semblable (à) eux","21:84:11":"avec eux,","21:84:12":"(par) miséricorde","21:84:13":"d’","21:84:14":"auprès (de) Nous","21:84:15":"et (pour être) un rappel","21:84:16":"pour les adorateurs.","21:85:1":"Et Ismaël","21:85:2":"et Idrîs","21:85:3":"et Dhou","21:85:4":"-l-Kifl.","21:85:5":"Tous","21:85:6":"(sont) parmi","21:85:7":"les endurants.","21:86:1":"Et Nous les avons certainement fait entrer","21:86:2":"dans","21:86:3":"Notre Miséricorde.","21:86:4":"Certes, ils","21:86:5":"(sont) parmi","21:86:6":"les vertueux.","21:87:1":"Et Dhou","21:87:2":"-n-Noûn","21:87:3":"quand","21:87:4":"il est parti","21:87:5":"en colère","21:87:6":"et a ensuite pensé","21:87:7":"que","21:87:8":"jamais","21:87:9":"Nous (ne) déciderons","21:87:10":"contre lui.","21:87:11":"Et Il a ensuite appelé","21:87:12":"dans","21:87:13":"les ténèbres","21:87:14":"que :","21:87:15":"« (Il n’y a) aucun"